ur AI workflows. Search the web, retrieve useful context, and keep the sources.</p><div class="ls-actions"><a class="ls-button" href="#make-your-first-search">Make your first search →</a><a href="/reference/search-api-guide-for-coding-agents" class="link">Building with an agent ↗</a></div><div class="ls-arch" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
<span data-as="p">LangSearch connects AI applications to information on the web. Send a query and receive structured results with source URLs and search snippets, or full webpage text when requested.</span>
<span data-as="p">Building with a coding agent? Share the <a href="/reference/search-api-guide-for-coding-agents" class="link">self-contained integration guide</a>.</span>
