<span data-as="p">Open the <a href="https://langsearch.com/dashboard" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Dashboard</a>, choose <strong>API keys</strong>, and create a key. Replace <code>YOUR_LANGSEARCH_API_KEY</code> below with your key. Run the request from a server or trusted local environment.</span>
